  "question": {
    "text": "If the area bounded by <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>64</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> square units, then the positive value of <math><mi>a</mi></math> is"
